cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GenoRefine or these release artifacts, please cite the software and the associated manuscript."
type: software
title: "GenoRefine: A Post-Integration Refinement Framework for Single-Cell RNA-Sequencing Embedding Geometry"
authors:
  - family-names: "Rahman"
    given-names: "Ariana"
  - family-names: "Mostafa"
    given-names: "Sakib"
  - family-names: "Xing"
    given-names: "Lei"
  - family-names: "Islam"
    given-names: "Md. Tauhidul"
repository-code: "https://github.com/arianarahman/GenoRefine"
url: "https://github.com/arianarahman/GenoRefine"
abstract: >-
  GenoRefine is a post-integration refinement framework for single-cell
  RNA-sequencing embedding geometry. This research-artifact release contains
  frozen analysis code, aggregate results, provenance records, and derived
  figures; it does not distribute raw or cell-level data.
keywords:
  - single-cell RNA sequencing
  - data integration
  - representation learning
  - spatial transcriptomics
